Package: erdem2026ductalapc
Title: Single-Cell Analysis for Erdem et al. 2026 (Diabetologia)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Denis", "O'Meally", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7749-9506")),
    person("John S.", "Kaddis", role = "aut"),
    person("Hsun Teresa", "Ku", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Reproduces the single-cell RNA-seq figures (Fig. 1j, Fig. 1k and
    ESM Fig. 2a) from Erdem et al., Human pancreatic ductal cells from
    non-diabetic donors function as non-professional antigen-presenting cells
    upon inflammatory cytokine exposure, Diabetologia 2026;69(8):2323-2337,
    doi:10.1007/s00125-026-06746-x. Not an installable package; the
    dependencies below are what the pipeline needs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports:
    targets (>= 1.5.0),
    Seurat (>= 5.0.0),
    UCell (>= 2.4.0),
    BiocParallel,
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    tibble,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    svglite (>= 2.1.0),
    systemfonts (>= 1.0.0),
    lme4 (>= 1.1-35),
    lmerTest,
    glmmTMB (>= 1.1-8),
    broom.mixed
SystemRequirements: Arial, or a metric-compatible substitute such as
    Liberation Sans (Debian/Ubuntu: fonts-liberation; RHEL/Fedora:
    liberation-sans-fonts). Without one, figure text falls back to the
    system default and glyph spacing may differ from the published figures.
